WEBVTT

00:05:58.979 --> 00:06:01.232
and then suddenly appear
walking down the street

00:06:01.273 --> 00:06:02.858
beside you in augmented reality?

00:06:02.858 --> 00:06:05.528
Like, that digital bridge
doesn't exist yet.

00:06:06.028 --> 00:06:07.405
But what if it did?

00:06:07.405 --> 00:06:10.241
And this brings me to my third pillar:

00:06:10.241 --> 00:06:12.034
decentralization.

00:06:12.368 --> 00:06:15.538
So for us to move seamlessly
through the metaverse,

00:06:15.579 --> 00:06:19.417
we need for our art and our avatars
to be decentralized.

00:06:19.417 --> 00:06:22.378
We can't be dependent
on a single platform.

00:06:22.378 --> 00:06:23.712
Sorry, Zuck.

00:06:24.296 --> 00:06:25.548
(Laughs)

00:06:25.548 --> 00:06:27.550
I mean, what if that platform were to die?

00:06:27.591 --> 00:06:29.135
We don't want to lose our art.

00:06:29.552 --> 00:06:30.719
So NFTs --